      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You can’t say \"I want two milk\"!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：啊？为什么？你想喝奶，我也想喝奶，那不是“二奶”吗？",
      "traditional": "本：啊？為什麼？你想喝奶，我也想喝奶，那不是“二奶”嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn a wèi shén me nǐ xiǎng hē nǎi wǒ yě xiǎng hē nǎi nà bú shì èr nǎi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ah? Why? You want to drink milk, I also want to drink milk, isn’t that “two milk”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：在中文里，“二奶”是“小老婆”的意思，不是“两杯牛奶”的意思。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：在中文裡，“二奶”是“小老婆”的意思，不是“兩杯牛奶”的意思。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zài zhōng wén lǐ èr nǎi shì xiǎo lǎo pó de yì si bú shì liǎng bēi niú nǎi de yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "你说“我要二奶”，哪个服务员敢过来啊！",
      "traditional": "你說“我要二奶”，哪個服務員敢過來啊！",
      "pinyin": "nǐ shuō wǒ yào èr nǎi nǎ ge fú wù yuán gǎn guò lái a",
      "english": "Lili: In Chinese, “two milk” means “mistress”, it doesn't mean “two glasses of milk”."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you say “I want a mistress”, what waiter would dare to come over!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "本：天啊！中文太难了！服务员，我要两杯牛奶。",
      "traditional": "本：天啊！中文太難了！服務員，我要兩杯牛奶。",
      "pinyin": "běn tiān a zhōng wén tài nán le fú wù yuán wǒ yào liǎng bēi niú nǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Heavens! Chinese is so difficult! Waiter, I want two glasses of milk."
    }
